 examine our matrices.\n\n- $A$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $B$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n- $C$ is a block lower triangular matrix. Indeed, we can partition it as follows:\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A,$ $B,$ and $C.$\"" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315690 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315691 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315692 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315693 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1000 #edb/ref 17592186315694 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1041 "selection" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1104 #edb/ref 17592186315694 13194139534863 true] [17592186315689 1110 #uuid "6ccfc720-7cde-5838-b866-ad7d7b97f187" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315690 1034 "$A$ and $C$ only" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315690 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534863 true] [17592186315690 1111 #uuid "150adcfa-c257-57d2-b5aa-60b2b722ebb3" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315691 1034 "None" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315691 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534863 true] [17592186315691 1111 #uuid "58fcb4dc-c24a-5e70-802d-784912444ee8" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315692 1034 "$A$ and $B$ only" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315692 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534863 true] [17592186315692 1111 #uuid "abcef4c7-98ae-518a-9145-ae835e7b6c88" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315693 1034 "$B$ only" 13194139534863 true] [17592186315693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534863 true] [17592186315693 1111 #uuid "18190dd9-3eb5-52c6-8f33-ee28